meta {
  name: 04 - Missing DocumentId (Natural Clarification)
  type: http
  seq: 4
}

post {
  url: {{base_url}}/api/agent/chat
  body: json
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
}

body:json {
  {
    "conversationId": "agent-test-4",
    "message": "What does my loan agreement say about prepayment?"
  }
}

docs {
  No documentId provided. Unlike the Step 4 router's hardcoded fallback
  message, the agentic version's tool description instructs the model
  to ask the user for the documentId conversationally rather than
  guessing - this tests that the model actually does so, as a genuine
  reasoning behavior rather than a hardcoded string.
}
